1
00:00:00,576 --> 00:00:03,360
The sun blazes overhead.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:08,592
A fierce championship match is underway on the tennis court.

3
00:00:08,592 --> 00:00:14,688
Beelu cheers his classmate Little South on with all his might.

4
00:00:14,688 --> 00:00:16,128
Little South!

5
00:00:16,128 --> 00:00:17,225
You can do it!

6
00:00:17,225 --> 00:00:17,950
Hah!

7
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,456
The match is over!

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,120
Little South slams the ball down

9
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:29,856
and wins the gold medal.

10
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,501
Sigh...

11
00:00:32,501 --> 00:00:33,749
Huh?

12
00:00:33,749 --> 00:00:35,861
But Beelu notices

13
00:00:35,861 --> 00:00:38,741
that although Little South is smiling,

14
00:00:38,741 --> 00:00:43,253
his mind seems to be somewhere else.

15
00:00:43,253 --> 00:00:45,845
After the match,

16
00:00:45,845 --> 00:00:51,947
the tennis team heads out shopping together.

17
00:00:51,947 --> 00:00:52,875
Sigh...

18
00:00:54,677 --> 00:00:55,781
Little South,

19
00:00:55,781 --> 00:00:57,077
what's wrong?

20
00:00:57,077 --> 00:00:59,908
You don't look very happy.

21
00:00:59,908 --> 00:01:02,500
Mom originally said

22
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:05,284
she would come watch me play today,

23
00:01:05,284 --> 00:01:07,300
but she didn't show up...

24
00:01:08,825 --> 00:01:10,948
Little South had been preparing

25
00:01:10,948 --> 00:01:13,828
for this match for a long time.

26
00:01:15,925 --> 00:01:17,812
Even though the match is over,

27
00:01:17,812 --> 00:01:18,580
you can still

28
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:21,652
tell her the good news that you won a medal.

29
00:01:21,652 --> 00:01:24,340
But if Mom didn't come to the match,

30
00:01:24,340 --> 00:01:27,748
she must still be busy.

31
00:01:27,748 --> 00:01:31,252
I don't think I should bother her...

32
00:01:31,252 --> 00:01:32,308
I'm sure it's fine.

33
00:01:32,308 --> 00:01:33,220
When she sees your gold medal,

34
00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:35,524
your mom will be so happy for you.

35
00:01:36,724 --> 00:01:39,748
Hmm...

36
00:01:39,748 --> 00:01:40,612
Okay!

37
00:01:41,812 --> 00:01:45,748
They head to Little South's family home together.

38
00:01:45,748 --> 00:01:49,780
Little South's mom works here.

39
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:53,572
When he sees the tall, enormous gate tower,

40
00:01:53,572 --> 00:01:56,836
Beelu lets out a loud gasp.

41
00:01:56,836 --> 00:01:57,748
Whoa!

42
00:01:57,748 --> 00:01:59,332
That's a huge gate!

43
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,275
Heh-heh.

44
00:02:01,275 --> 00:02:02,225
That's because

45
00:02:02,225 --> 00:02:04,682
everyone in my family except me

46
00:02:04,682 --> 00:02:07,475
is an elephant!

47
00:02:07,475 --> 00:02:08,325
Wow! Cool!

48
00:02:10,056 --> 00:02:12,024
Inside the main hall,

49
00:02:12,024 --> 00:02:16,296
the walls are covered with bright red decorations.

50
00:02:16,296 --> 00:02:19,050
They're beautiful.

51
00:02:19,050 --> 00:02:20,088
Oh?

52
00:02:20,088 --> 00:02:21,725
What's that?

53
00:02:21,725 --> 00:02:24,888
Those are Five Blessings paper decorations that Mom and I made.

54
00:02:24,888 --> 00:02:27,912
We put them above the doorway to pray for safety.

55
00:02:27,912 --> 00:02:30,024
Oh!

56
00:02:30,024 --> 00:02:33,960
Little South's mom is a paper-art expert.

57
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:36,840
Her creations can be found all over the house.

58
00:02:39,524 --> 00:02:40,536
Mom!

59
00:02:40,536 --> 00:02:43,128
I brought a friend to visit.

60
00:02:43,128 --> 00:02:44,712
This is Beelu.

61
00:02:44,712 --> 00:02:45,912
Hello, ma'am!

62
00:02:46,632 --> 00:02:49,992
Little South's mom nods

63
00:02:49,992 --> 00:02:52,776
and continues carefully cutting paper.

64
00:02:52,776 --> 00:02:54,120
She doesn't even notice

65
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:57,192
the gold medal Little South is wearing.

66
00:02:57,192 --> 00:02:59,352
Seeing his mom's reaction,

67
00:02:59,352 --> 00:03:02,520
Little South feels very sad.

68
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,200
Let's move a little closer.

69
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:04,920
Okay!

70
00:03:05,812 --> 00:03:08,452
Little South gathers his courage

71
00:03:08,452 --> 00:03:11,092
and puts his gold medal on the table.

72
00:03:12,425 --> 00:03:15,844
His mom squints

73
00:03:15,844 --> 00:03:20,500
as she carefully works on the final details.

74
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:23,380
But the light reflecting off the medal

75
00:03:23,380 --> 00:03:27,124
suddenly shines into her eyes.

76
00:03:27,124 --> 00:03:28,600
Whoa!

77
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:33,556
Little South's mom raises her trunk to block the glare,

78
00:03:33,556 --> 00:03:37,780
but accidentally knocks the medal flying.

79
00:03:40,036 --> 00:03:41,525
Uh...

80
00:03:43,375 --> 00:03:44,250
I'm sorry!

81
00:03:44,250 --> 00:03:47,476
Am I getting in the way of your work, Mom?

82
00:03:47,476 --> 00:03:51,172
I didn't mean to, Mom!

83
00:03:51,172 --> 00:03:54,340
Little South's mom looks up

84
00:03:54,340 --> 00:03:58,084
and sees the disappointment on his face.

85
00:03:58,852 --> 00:04:00,676
Little South turns around.

86
00:04:00,676 --> 00:04:01,150
Little South!

87
00:04:01,150 --> 00:04:02,980
In the blink of an eye, he flies away.

88
00:04:04,660 --> 00:04:05,956
How did this happen...?

89
00:04:05,956 --> 00:04:08,020
I promised Little South...

90
00:04:08,020 --> 00:04:11,332
His mom is filled with regret.

91
00:04:11,332 --> 00:04:13,675
She had so much work to do.

92
00:04:13,675 --> 00:04:16,948
She had been working from last night until just now,

93
00:04:16,948 --> 00:04:20,275
hoping to finish everything

94
00:04:20,275 --> 00:04:22,372
so she could go watch Little South's match.

95
00:04:22,372 --> 00:04:26,356
Instead, she ended up missing it.

96
00:04:29,524 --> 00:04:31,060
I'm sorry, ma'am.

97
00:04:31,060 --> 00:04:34,948
Actually, I was the one who suggested we do this.

98
00:04:37,204 --> 00:04:38,740
It's okay.

99
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:39,748
I'm the one at fault.

100
00:04:39,748 --> 00:04:42,388
I forgot my promise to Little South.

101
00:04:42,388 --> 00:04:44,250
Hmm...

102
00:04:44,250 --> 00:04:45,172
Beelu,

103
00:04:45,172 --> 00:04:47,908
could I ask you a favor?

104
00:04:47,908 --> 00:04:49,732
What is it?

105
00:04:49,732 --> 00:04:53,236
Could you come with me to look for Little South?

106
00:04:53,236 --> 00:04:53,860
Okay!

107
00:04:54,647 --> 00:05:00,119
Little South's mom wants to give him a proper apology.

108
00:05:00,119 --> 00:05:01,751
Little South!

109
00:05:01,751 --> 00:05:03,383
Little South!

110
00:05:03,383 --> 00:05:04,919
Little South!

111
00:05:04,919 --> 00:05:06,791
Little South!

112
00:05:06,791 --> 00:05:08,759
Where are you, Little South?

113
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:10,439
Little South!

114
00:05:11,575 --> 00:05:15,097
Even after searching everywhere,

115
00:05:15,097 --> 00:05:17,641
Little South's mom and Beelu

116
00:05:17,641 --> 00:05:20,137
still can't find him.

117
00:05:20,137 --> 00:05:25,561
The two of them are getting tired.

118
00:05:29,050 --> 00:05:31,993
The sky gradually grows dark.

119
00:05:31,993 --> 00:05:33,275
They hold on to a little hope,

120
00:05:33,275 --> 00:05:36,793
hoping to find Little South when they get home.

121
00:05:36,793 --> 00:05:37,657
But sadly,

122
00:05:37,657 --> 00:05:39,961
he isn't there, either.

123
00:05:41,125 --> 00:05:42,207
I'm sorry.

124
00:05:42,207 --> 00:05:44,367
I made you come all over the place with me.

125
00:05:44,367 --> 00:05:47,487
I'll keep looking on my own later.

126
00:05:47,487 --> 00:05:49,071
It's okay.

127
00:05:49,071 --> 00:05:52,350
Little South is hard to catch when we play tag, too.

128
00:05:52,350 --> 00:05:54,447
He's really fast!

129
00:05:54,447 --> 00:05:55,695
Really?

130
00:05:57,086 --> 00:05:58,300
When Little South was little,

131
00:05:58,300 --> 00:06:00,926
he wasn't very athletic.

132
00:06:00,926 --> 00:06:03,710
He even got hurt the first time he tried flying.

133
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:04,670
But

134
00:06:04,670 --> 00:06:07,694
after I gave him a good-luck charm,

135
00:06:07,694 --> 00:06:09,374
he was so happy.

136
00:06:09,374 --> 00:06:10,910
Even when he fell,

137
00:06:10,910 --> 00:06:12,830
he kept getting back up and trying again

138
00:06:12,830 --> 00:06:15,470
until he finally learned to fly.

139
00:06:16,670 --> 00:06:19,742
I wish I could see how Little South plays on the court.

140
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:23,726
We have to find him soon.

141
00:06:23,726 --> 00:06:26,606
Listening to his mom,

142
00:06:26,606 --> 00:06:31,070
Beelu can tell that she and her son are very close.

143
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:33,720
But now, something has come between them.

144
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:38,040
Beelu really wants to help them

145
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:40,056
make up.

146
00:06:40,056 --> 00:06:44,325
But how can they find Little South?

147
00:06:46,850 --> 00:06:47,640
That's it!

148
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,464
We can use this!

149
00:06:49,464 --> 00:06:52,135
The sun is about to set.

150
00:06:52,135 --> 00:06:55,783
Little South remains hidden, heartbroken.

151
00:06:55,783 --> 00:06:57,175
Suddenly, in the sky,

152
00:06:57,175 --> 00:06:59,200
one little dot after another

153
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,256
appears in red.

154
00:07:00,256 --> 00:07:02,800
Little South is captivated.

155
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:05,225
One of the red dots

156
00:07:05,225 --> 00:07:08,150
flies straight toward him.

157
00:07:08,150 --> 00:07:10,642
It's a paper airplane!

158
00:07:11,850 --> 00:07:12,825
What's this?

159
00:07:13,618 --> 00:07:15,250
The picture inside

160
00:07:15,250 --> 00:07:18,946
is a silhouette of Little South and his mom.

161
00:07:18,946 --> 00:07:19,625
It turns out

162
00:07:19,625 --> 00:07:23,602
this is a congratulatory message from his mom.

163
00:07:23,602 --> 00:07:27,778
They've been sending paper airplanes all over the streets,

164
00:07:27,778 --> 00:07:28,930
believing

165
00:07:28,930 --> 00:07:30,850
that one of them

166
00:07:30,850 --> 00:07:33,010
will surely reach Little South.

167
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:37,826
Just then,

168
00:07:37,826 --> 00:07:39,458
Little South's mom

169
00:07:39,458 --> 00:07:42,338
finally spots him.

170
00:07:44,114 --> 00:07:45,506
I finally found you!

171
00:07:46,706 --> 00:07:48,530
Mom...

172
00:07:48,530 --> 00:07:49,394
I'm sorry.

173
00:07:49,394 --> 00:07:51,650
I forgot to come to your match.

174
00:07:51,650 --> 00:07:53,618
Can you forgive me?

175
00:07:54,967 --> 00:07:56,455
It's okay.

176
00:07:56,455 --> 00:07:59,287
I know you've been really busy lately, Mom.

177
00:07:59,287 --> 00:08:00,535
I'm sorry, Mom.

178
00:08:01,783 --> 00:08:04,711
At last, they make up.

179
00:08:07,207 --> 00:08:09,319
The sun sets.

180
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:12,775
Little South and his mom hold hands

181
00:08:12,775 --> 00:08:15,847
as they walk home.

182
00:08:15,847 --> 00:08:17,959
Beelu walks ahead of them

183
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:20,023
holding the paper airplane

184
00:08:20,023 --> 00:08:22,231
and waving it around.

185
00:08:22,231 --> 00:08:24,487
Today was so much fun!

186
00:08:26,025 --> 00:08:29,719
Today, Beelu visited Liudui.

187
00:08:29,719 --> 00:08:31,975
He took part in a sports day

188
00:08:31,975 --> 00:08:34,375
and made

189
00:08:34,375 --> 00:08:38,215
many unforgettable memories with Little South's family.

190
00:08:38,215 --> 00:08:39,703
In the story,

191
00:08:39,703 --> 00:08:41,479
Little South and his mom

192
00:08:41,479 --> 00:08:42,967
are a bat

193
00:08:42,967 --> 00:08:45,031
and an elephant.

194
00:08:45,031 --> 00:08:45,991
It turns out

195
00:08:45,991 --> 00:08:48,679
Little South was adopted by his mom.

196
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:50,215
Even so,

197
00:08:50,215 --> 00:08:53,191
his mom's love for Little South

198
00:08:53,191 --> 00:08:55,687
hasn't diminished one bit.

199
00:08:55,687 --> 00:08:56,887
Kids,

200
00:08:56,887 --> 00:09:01,687
what did you learn from Little South's family?

201
00:09:01,687 --> 00:09:06,151
If family members don't have to be related by blood,

202
00:09:06,151 --> 00:09:09,799
what do you think makes someone family?

203
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:12,343
The video is over!

204
00:09:12,343 --> 00:09:14,599
Kids,

205
00:09:14,599 --> 00:09:18,151
remember to give your eyes a little rest!
